                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naakuli uukambauka, akambauke mbuli uuamba majwi aa-Leza. Naakuli uubeleka milimo, abeleke kunguzu nzyamupa Leza, kuti kumakani oonse Leza akalemekwe muli-Jesu Kristo, Ngonguwe ngusyaatwakwe abulemu abwami lyoonse alyoonse kukabe kutamani. Ameni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
