        },
        {
          "text": "Na mwasampaulwa nkaambo kazina lya-Kristo, elyo muli basicoolwe, ikuti ndilyonya ndimukalilide Muuya wabulemu, nkokuti Muuya wa-Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
